\tag{discrete}
\taxon{Remark}

\import{discrete-macros}

\p{The way we expand out #{\forall} and #{\exists} is very similar—but different in a crucial way. With [forall](00HR), we introduce an implication, whereas with [exists](00HS), we introduce a conjunction (and).  Hopefully the reasons make sense to you, but you can also just memorize this!}
